WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.947
Wuro ɗon wi'aay kooɗume.

00:00:02.027 --> 00:00:07.101
Nde nyalnde waɗi, o wi'i, "To subaka, en njannginan ɗum fuu".

00:00:07.181 --> 00:00:13.774
Hyenniyankeejo ɗon nyaama ɓikkoy maako: o haani nyaamugo koo ɗume haa o nyaama!

00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:18.336
Nder jemma maajum o yahi nder suudu nyaamdu, o nyaami.

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:20.195
O nyaami haa o nyaama.

00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:24.081
Nde o yiɗi wurta, ɓernde maako ɓeydi ɓeydaaki.
